{
  "source": "course-assets/avoid-traps-opener/avoid-traps-opener.mp4",
  "duration": 110.7413125,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 6.38,
      "text": "The underlying architecture that makes artificial intelligence so capable at generating language and images"
    },
    {
      "start": 6.38,
      "end": 10.08,
      "text": "is the exact same machinery that causes it to fail."
    },
    {
      "start": 10.92,
      "end": 15.58,
      "text": "These failures are highly predictable. They happen in specific, repeating patterns."
    },
    {
      "start": 16.18,
      "end": 19.86,
      "text": "The real danger for the user is the complete lack of friction."
    },
    {
      "start": 20.7,
      "end": 24.92,
      "text": "When a language model hallucinates, you don't get a flashing red light or an error code."
    },
    {
      "start": 24.92,
      "end": 30.88,
      "text": "A completely fabricated statistic arrives with absolute certainty and a highly authoritative"
    },
    {
      "start": 30.88,
      "end": 31.26,
      "text": "tone."
    },
    {
      "start": 32.06,
      "end": 33.54,
      "text": "Think about a coastal rip current."
    },
    {
      "start": 34.22,
      "end": 36.84,
      "text": "To the untrained eye, this doesn't look like a hazard."
    },
    {
      "start": 37.42,
      "end": 42.24,
      "text": "A calm, flat channel situated right between breaking waves looks like the most inviting"
    },
    {
      "start": 42.24,
      "end": 43.0,
      "text": "place to swim."
    },
    {
      "start": 43.64,
      "end": 50.0,
      "text": "But that smooth surface is actually masking a powerful, concentrated column of water moving"
    },
    {
      "start": 50.0,
      "end": 51.7,
      "text": "in the exact opposite direction."
    },
    {
      "start": 51.7,
      "end": 58.18,
      "text": "If you step into that calm water, the current will quickly and quietly pull you far away from the shore."
    },
    {
      "start": 58.74,
      "end": 64.84,
      "text": "The actual survival skill is identifying the specific shape of the hazard before your feet leave the sand."
    },
    {
      "start": 65.78,
      "end": 73.54,
      "text": "Professional lifeguards spot these traps constantly because they are trained to recognize the visual signature of that suspiciously calm water."
    },
    {
      "start": 74.28,
      "end": 78.68,
      "text": "Interacting with artificial intelligence requires this exact same preventative mindset."
    },
    {
      "start": 78.68,
      "end": 88.6,
      "text": "The technology has its own digital rip currents, and safely utilizing these tools means recognizing their specific shapes before you get pulled into the deception."
    },
    {
      "start": 89.32,
      "end": 92.02,
      "text": "This section will help you answer three specific questions."
    },
    {
      "start": 92.66,
      "end": 95.58,
      "text": "Why can AI sound so sure and still be wrong?"
    },
    {
      "start": 96.24,
      "end": 98.34,
      "text": "When might I be trusting AI too much?"
    },
    {
      "start": 98.9,
      "end": 103.96,
      "text": "If AI can create convincing fakes, what should I check before trusting what I see or hear?"
    },
    {
      "start": 104.5,
      "end": 106.96,
      "text": "When AI fails, nothing looks broken."
    },
    {
      "start": 106.96,
      "end": 109.68,
      "text": "This section teaches you to read the water."
    }
  ],
